SUMMARY:The Neon Room at Helium: Jourdain Fisher
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Jourdain Fisher is a New York based comedian\, actor\, writer a
 nd content creator\, who was born and raised in North Carolina. He started 
 doing standup comedy at the age of 17 to avoid working for his family's fun
 eral home. Jourdain has been a part of various festivals including\, The Ne
 w York Comedy Festival (New Yorks Funniest)\, Laughing Skull Festival\, and
  Laugh Your Asheville Off. Jourdain was also a back-to-back winner of The U
 ltimate Comic Challenge\, and a finalist in The Carolina's Funniest Competi
 tion as well as a finalist at the NBC Stand Up Showcase. Jourdain was previ
 ously a writer and actor on BET's sketch comedy show\, 50 Central and a wri
 ter on The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon. Jourdain was also recently a pan
 elist on CBS/Paramount+’s After Midnight with Taylor Tomlinson. Jourdain 
 has also found success on social media through his wildly popular character
  Gangsta Che.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from en
 tering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.
